<mxCell id="v7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px&quot;&gt;Current tourism information management practices of the Municipal Tourism Office&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px&quot;&gt;Operational issues under the current decentralized process&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px&quot;&gt;Identified functional and non-functional requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;gathered from tourists, Tourism Officers, and Establishment Managers&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;spacing=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
